# DevOps Agentic Development Platform (DAP)

Multi-tenant SaaS coding sandbox built on a custom Lite VM + Lite Linux Ubuntu OS,
with an embedded Lite IDE and agentic AI coding assistants.

## Architecture Overview

```
┌───────────────────────┐     ┌──────────────────┐
│    Client Layer       │     │  Edge & Gateway   │
│ Browser / VS Code Ext│────▶│ WAF + API GW     │
└───────────────────────┘     └────────┬─────────┘
                                      │
                    ┌───────────────▼───────────────┐
                    │  Control Plane (FastAPI)      │
                    ├───────────────┬───────────────┤
                    │ Auth Service  │ Workspace     │
                    │ (IAM/RBAC)    │ Orchestrator  │
                    ├───────────────┤───────────────┤
                    │ Sandbox LM    │ Agentic AI    │
                    │ (VM lifecycle)│ Engine        │
                    ├───────────────┤───────────────┤
                    │ Observability │ Dashboard     │
                    │ Collector     │ API           │
                    └───────────────┴───────────────┘
                                      │
                    ┌───────────────▼───────────────┐
                    │  Data Plane (Shared Services)   │
                    ├───────────────┬───────────────┤
                    │ Lite VM Pool  │ Redis Cluster   │
                    │ (Ubuntu 24.04)│ PostgreSQL +    │
                    └───────────────┤ pgVector 0.8.0  │
                    └───────────────┴───────────────┘

## Key Features

- **Multi-Tenant**: Isolated sandboxes per user/team with RBAC
- **Embedded IDE**: Monaco Editor with LSP integration, real-time diagnostics
- **Agentic AI Engine**: Multi-agent system (Code Architect, Debugger, Test Generator)
- **Plugin Architecture**: Extensible stacks (Python, Rust, Node.js, ML/Data)
- **Zero-Trust Network**: Cilium eBPF enforcement, whitelist-only egress
- **Observability**: Prometheus metrics, Grafana dashboards, full audit trail

## Development Stacks in Sandbox

| Stack | Runtime | Tools |
|-------|---------|-------|
| Python | 3.12 + pip | FastAPI, SQLite |
| Rust | 1.70+ + cargo | Actix-web |
| Node.js | 20.x + npm/yarn | React, Express |
| ML/Data | Python | pgVector 0.8.0, Ollama, LangGraph |

## Security Controls

- **IAM**: OAuth2/OIDC authentication via Keycloak/Auth0
- **RBAC**: GA > Team Admin > Developer > Read-Only hierarchy
- **GA**: General Admin with system-wide override capabilities
- **Network**: Zero-trust via Cilium eBPF, whitelist-only outbound

## Quick Start (Development)

```bash
# 1. Clone & setup
git clone <repo> && cd devops-agentic-platform

# 2. Create virtual environment
python -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate

# 3. Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# 4. Start full stack (Docker Compose)
docker compose up -d

# 5. Open dashboard
open http://localhost:3001   # Grafana/Grafana UI

# 6. Create first workspace
curl -X POST http://localhost:8002/workspaces \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer <token>" \
  -d '{"name": "my-workspace", "tier": "pro"}'
```

